# Knocking on Forbidden Doors (otherAreas 78): the ladder's 38 against its own script. The Wooden Ladder script plays the
# ladder cutscene of the box the char stands in (ladder 4, LADDER_KNOCKING: event 24, x -224.1 to -212.1, y -1 to 1, z 12
# to 24, the ladder closer than 1.95). The char walks into that box (y -0.5) and talks from there. Accepted at Prog 1 (a
# GM; the chain before it completed): 38 (27), finished: Prog 2. Prog 1 again (a GM): 38 again (a Progress action beats
# the script every time; an Event one would hand the second talk to the script: its 24). Prog 2: no quest action: the
# script's 24.
lists PhomiunaAqueducts/Wooden_Ladder/onTrigger PhomiunaAqueducts/onEventFinish/38
char zone=PhomiunaAqueducts pos=-216.6,-1.5,18.1 job=WAR lvl=75
quest OtherAreas.ItsRainingMannequins completed
quest OtherAreas.BehindTheSmile completed
quest OtherAreas.KnockingOnForbiddenDoors accepted
charvar Quest[4][78]Prog 1
login
walk -216.9,-0.5,18.1
trigger LADDER_KNOCKING here            # Prog 1, in the ladder's box: 38 (27)
finish                                  # Prog 2
charvar Quest[4][78]Prog 1              # a GM
trigger LADDER_KNOCKING here            # 38 again (Progress)
finish                                  # Prog 2
trigger LADDER_KNOCKING here            # Prog 2: no quest action; the script: the ladder's 24
finish-if-event
